&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hi, my name is Megan Berry, Senior Director of Product Management at &lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;, and I&#39;m looking for a Product Manager to improve how customers experience their first weeks with us. Our self-serve business is a growing part of how customers discover and adopt &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;, and this role sits at the center of that motion, working alongside our Senior PM on the self-serve pod. You&#39;ll have real ownership over a defined slice of the journey, with the data, experimentation muscle, and cross-functional partners to move it.&lt;/p&gt;
