&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter Call&lt;/strong&gt; (30 mins) - Let’s chat about what you’re looking for and how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager &amp;amp; AI Skills Interview (60 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; - We&#39;ll explore ownership, autonomy, and collaboration, then dig into how you actually use AI in your day-to-day workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical AI-Enabled Coding Round (60 mins)&lt;/strong&gt; - A live, collaborative session where you&#39;ll extend a sample SDK using AI tools. Wwe want to see how you think and work with AI as part of your process.&lt;/li&gt;
