&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&#39;m Manu, Engineering Manager at &lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;. We&#39;re looking for experienced backend engineers who want to build and own the infrastructure that powers one of the most data-intensive platforms in marketing automation — systems that process millions of events per second, orchestrate complex workflows at scale, and keep everything running reliably for thousands of customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on the Platform team, tackling hard distributed systems problems: designing for fault tolerance, scaling services under real production pressure, and building the foundational layers that every other team at &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; depends on. This isn&#39;t just maintenance work — you&#39;ll shape the architecture of systems that need to be both highly available and constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
