&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed systems and large-scale backend architecture&lt;/li&gt;
