&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pulling usage data, tracking health scores, and building your own dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator — clear and persuasive with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK or Ireland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
